1
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:27,680
My wife,

2
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:29,640
you

3
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:30,680
must

4
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:32,039
live

5
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:34,600
well.

6
00:01:36,479 --> 00:01:37,840
Live on.

7
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:48,400
To think they brought in the guards.

8
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:51,720
What a pity for such a large stronghold.

9
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:53,840
Wuyou City

10
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:56,280
needs to be cleaned up.

11
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:09,600
Heizi.

12
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:15,160
Meng Qian.

13
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,800
Didn't I tell you to go home?

14
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,400
Why are you still at the pier?

15
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,760
Just because you tell me to go home,

16
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:24,960
doesn't mean I will.

17
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:28,840
I told you,

18
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:31,400
guiding those people is a death wish.

19
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:34,160
I wanted you to go home and live well.

20
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:37,400
Meng Qian,

21
00:02:38,440 --> 00:02:39,120
I've always

22
00:02:40,079 --> 00:02:41,840
refused to accept you.

23
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:44,280
We are both at Sangjia Wazi

24
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,850
trying to make a living.

25
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,000
Why is it

26
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:49,000
that you have the reputation?

27
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:49,400
I...

28
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,960
I don't accept it.

29
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,050
I just wanted

30
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,600
to pull off a big job.

31
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,410
What big job could you pull off?

32
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,560
You really are...

33
00:02:59,040 --> 00:02:59,680
I wanted

34
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:02,890
to help them kill the Master of Wuyou Cave.

35
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:06,100
Then I'd surely get famous and outshine you.

36
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:07,780
I didn't expect

37
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,240
the Master of Wuyou Cave

38
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:09,800
to be

39
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:10,940
killed now.

40
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:12,720
But I

41
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,760
didn't even

42
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,400
get famous.

43
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,240
What did you just say?

44
00:03:18,880 --> 00:03:20,880
The Master of Wuyou Cave was killed?

45
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:22,020
Who killed him?

46
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:27,720
Heizi.

47
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:29,400
Heizi!

48
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:30,480
Heizi!

49
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:58,860
Your Highness.

50
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:02,410
There was a fierce battle at the Xishuimen Pier just now.

51
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:03,840
The Cave Master's double

52
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,240
is dead.

53
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,240
Who did it?

54
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:11,120
It was a melee among several parties,

55
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,450
but the real mastermind

56
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:14,970
should be the Knife Seller's arch-enemy.

57
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,279
Never mind.

58
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:21,930
Since he wants to create the illusion of the Wuyou Cave Master's death,

59
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,300
we will grant his wish.

60
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:27,050
Since when is it Zhou You's business to catch rebels?

61
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,160
A young lady went missing from the Zhao Manor.

62
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:31,280
Li Yi'an asked Zhou You for help.

63
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,720
When Li Yi'an came to the capital this time,

64
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:36,360
the Emperor had Zhou You escort her out of the palace.

65
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,200
Li Yi'an

66
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,600
probably got to know Zhou You because of that

67
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,860
and asked him for help.

68
00:04:41,159 --> 00:04:42,690
If there really are rebels,

69
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,920
tell your subordinates to be smart.

70
00:04:45,320 --> 00:04:47,520
Don't give away the credit for nothing.

71
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:48,280
Yes.

72
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:51,600
Tonight in Dongjing City,

73
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:54,080
there are constant disturbances.

74
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:57,240
Tomorrow is the Lantern Festival.

75
00:04:57,880 --> 00:04:59,200
This Fanlou

76
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:02,720
will probably experience another shock.

77
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:05,680
The unrest around Xishuimen Wharf

78
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:08,440
is said to be a melee between several rebel factions.

79
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:10,200
You could suggest to the Emperor

80
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:11,000
that tomorrow night

81
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,260
he refrain from visiting Fanlou for now.

82
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:25,520
Chen Wu.

83
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:26,560
Let go.

84
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,680
Let go!

85
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:29,200
What are you doing?

86
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:30,400
Why did you betray us?

87
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,320
How did I betray you?

88
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:36,120
Dare you say you didn't lead these guards here?

89
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:38,100
Dare you say you didn't report us?

90
00:05:38,159 --> 00:05:39,320
Why would I report you?

91
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:40,920
My sister's life is still in your hands.

92
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,250
Am I crazy to report you?

93
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:44,330
Then how did these guards get here?

94
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,360
The guards are catching assassins and rebels.

95
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:51,620
Naturally, they came because they found out where you are.

96
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:53,320
Dare you say

97
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:56,120
you're not going to Fan Restaurant to assassinate His Majesty?

98
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:56,980
Dare you say it?

99
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,360
Captain Chen.

100
00:05:58,760 --> 00:05:59,440
Let him go.

101
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:12,880
Brother Meng stopped us tonight.

102
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,400
I thought

103
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,080
you already knew.

104
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,420
I was guessing.

105
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,880
You never said from beginning to end

106
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,240
going to Fan Restaurant on Lantern Festival,

107
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:24,040
what exactly you are going to do.

108
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:25,800
Even if you knew,

109
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:26,490
what good

110
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,880
would it do you?

111
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,360
I didn't want to know at all.

112
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:33,420
But you threatened me with my sister.

113
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,600
Now that you know,

114
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:35,840
what can you do?

115
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:36,720
I...

116
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:39,800
I have been tortured by you for two days.

117
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:43,760
Could it be that you know

118
00:06:44,159 --> 00:06:45,400
something else?

119
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:49,080
If you go to Fan Restaurant

120
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:50,400
not to assassinate His Majesty,

121
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:51,360
just say it.

122
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,520
Otherwise,

123
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:55,050
you will face greater resistance.

124
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,000
If we say it,

125
00:06:58,640 --> 00:06:59,560
what then?

126
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:01,240
If you say it,

127
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:04,040
I can take you to see someone.

128
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:05,040
You.

129
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:09,520
Who knows if you'll betray us again?

130
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:10,720
I've said it several times.

131
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,760
My sister's life is in your hands.

132
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:13,020
Why would I betray you?

133
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:15,400
Believe it or not.

134
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:17,000
Anyway, that person is very powerful.

135
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,160
Enemies or allies,

136
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,720
you choose.

137
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:23,600
Don't be anxious, Brother Meng.

138
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:25,520
I also think

139
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,400
you make sense.

140
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:31,000
In our plan,

141
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:35,130
we are indeed missing the part of the people around His Majesty.

142
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:39,120
If Brother Meng can help us get through this,

143
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:40,480
that would be best.

144
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:41,800
But,

145
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:45,159
this ally you mentioned,

146
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,880
is he from the government?

147
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,140
My Lord.

148
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:03,800
I have something to tell you.

149
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,530
Where were you for the two hours

150
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:07,840
after the Yunxiang Restaurant incident?

151
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:09,320
Do you want to personally catch

152
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:11,780
the assassins who tried to kill His Majesty?

153
00:08:13,280 --> 00:08:14,210
What do you mean?

154
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:15,920
I met those people from Mount Liang

155
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:17,480
outside Yunxiang Restaurant.

156
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,610
I brought them here.

157
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,610
What did you say?

158
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:23,160
If you want to catch the real assassins, my Lord,

159
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,690
you'd better see them first

160
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,880
before deciding whether to make a move.

161
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:28,940
What nonsense are you talking about?

162
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:30,680
They

163
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:34,409
might not necessarily want to assassinate His Majesty.

164
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:37,799
Sister.

165
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:43,720
Meng just said

166
00:08:44,280 --> 00:08:46,610
you brought the guys from Liangshan here.

167
00:08:47,160 --> 00:08:47,960
Yes.

168
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:51,520
Sister.

169
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,600
Please invite them in.
